      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `0440622e77f1a7c463f1a593b2e7e0848802c7da92e165a96262162f5fa63b1b--criminal-courts-2024-25-cube-4-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2024\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7d4ac3a8aae72d6f81146e9b234e6afa8de72865e9fb49fa3ed162cc8e620e21 | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | 1c095c95d2def5f7acd362d3ab4204e3f0945eafb554ab23de9a5ae5b2c4db5d | missing |\n| \"Table 22\" | 64b6892a23d304ef07d5dbe435e9c78ab3a43344f54afc7f185f9ddbb4ded7f0 | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | 2bf7190d659462f003d8ffd44acf94025acb6de9a989692815b7f3f7e5ccd854 | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | 8b1707e48c5d6ce9df9a3515efe22deab55d7a8e1dfe1fdc48329c0f22b3d958 | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | b4d551a81ffaa4266d63097d8fe5f7ccc37c017b051ff824fe3484a8192dc792 | missing |\n| \"Table 26\" | a1c5f2caa4cc5790d040c454d478dbc5b331f5869e3fc579af492c54ffaaba89 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (bbe132070a9ef7e45c70d31376d8b2c9ea7696b6f8775ca9f8bcad45041f29f6). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
